## Article 5. Right to appeal to court and methods of judicial protection

```catala
declaration scope Article5RightToCourtProtection:
  input plaintiff content ApplicantType
  input rightsViolated content YesNo
  input freedomsViolated content YesNo
  input lawfulInterestsViolated content YesNo
  input disputeCategory content DisputeCategory
  input protectionMethod content ProtectionMethod
  input defendantIsSubjectOfAuthority content YesNo
  output hasRightToCourt content YesNo
  output protectionMethodAvailable content YesNo
  output waiverInvalid content YesNo
  output foreignerEqualProtection content YesNo

scope Article5RightToCourtProtection:
  label right_default definition hasRightToCourt equals No

  label rights_violated_exception exception right_default
  definition hasRightToCourt under condition
    (rightsViolated = Yes or freedomsViolated = Yes or lawfulInterestsViolated = Yes)
    and defendantIsSubjectOfAuthority = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label method_available_default definition protectionMethodAvailable equals No

  label normative_act_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = DeclareNormativeActUnlawful
    and disputeCategory = NormativeActChallenge
    consequence equals Yes

  label individual_act_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = CancelIndividualAct
    and disputeCategory = IndividualActChallenge
    consequence equals Yes

  label action_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = ProhibitAction
    and disputeCategory = ActionChallenge
    consequence equals Yes

  label inaction_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = CompelAction
    and disputeCategory = InactionChallenge
    consequence equals Yes

  label competence_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = EstablishCompetence
    and disputeCategory = CompetenceDispute
    consequence equals Yes

  label compensation_exception exception method_available_default
  definition protectionMethodAvailable under condition
    protectionMethod = CompelActionAndCompensation
    and disputeCategory = CompensationClaim
    consequence equals Yes

  label waiver_always_invalid definition waiverInvalid equals Yes

  label foreigner_equal_protection definition foreignerEqualProtection equals Yes
```

## Article 6. Rule of law in court

```catala
declaration scope Article6RuleOfLaw:
  input legislationIncomplete content YesNo
  input legislationUnclear content YesNo
  input legislationContradictory content YesNo
  input legislationAbsent content YesNo
  output canRefuseToHear content YesNo
  output canApplyConstitutionDirectly content YesNo

scope Article6RuleOfLaw:
  label cannot_refuse definition canRefuseToHear equals No

  label constitution_direct_exception exception no_direct
  definition canApplyConstitutionDirectly under condition
    legislationIncomplete = Yes
    or legislationUnclear = Yes
    or legislationContradictory = Yes
    or legislationAbsent = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_direct definition canApplyConstitutionDirectly equals No
```
